flowchart TD
  Cart[Supply Table cart edit] --> Quote[Cached pure spatial plan / existing prices / actual package envelopes]
  Quote --> Confirm[Show truck count and complete fee before one Confirm]
  Confirm --> Ledger[Receiving creates actual trucks / drivers / packet stock / same eight people]
  Ledger --> Traffic[Owned supplier route / real body and handling clearance]
  Traffic --> Berths[Separate materials and passenger stops]
  Berths --> Open[Stopped material truck / existing door then ramp clips]
  Open --> Ready[Reserve exact accessible packet / actual worker and shelf cell]
  Ready -->|fixture needed| Prepare[Existing real worker visit / shelf smoke / ready event]
  Prepare --> Rear[Walk to rear / actual aisle and ramp route]
  Prepare -->|truck aisle busy| Queue[Release shelf standing face but retain package cell / walk to distinct outside wait point]
  Queue -->|actual aisle-release event| Rear
  Rear --> Access[Ledger retains actual supplier access until physical rear exit]
  Access --> Lift
  Access --> Cancel[Before lift: release uncollected claim / safe rear exit / pending duty applies]
  Ready -->|ready shelf| Rear
  Rear --> Lift{Timber?}
  Lift -->|no| Single[One actual worker / existing25kg allowance]
  Lift -->|yes| Pair[Two actual workers / one jointly owned stock carry]
  Single --> Carry[Physical package extraction and carry]
  Pair --> Carry
  Carry --> Deposit[One actual warehouse deposit / consume reserved cell]
  Ready -->|no storage or partner| Hold[Cargo stays aboard / specific event-woken warning]
  Deposit --> Clear[Release actual source access / exact stock handover]
  Clear --> Close[Last carry clears rear / ramp stow / door close]
  Berths --> Passengers[Actual seated IDs / rear-to-front clearance / stand-walk-crouch-jump-land]
  Passengers --> Walk[Same passenger walks to actual arrival point]
  Passengers --> PassengerClear[Last passenger landed and rear clear]
  Walk --> Arrived[Arrival converts reserved population once]
  Close --> Departure[Actual clear departure or bypass / otherwise event-wait]
  PassengerClear --> Departure
  Arrived --> Gate[Convoy gate requires every actual handover and departure start]
  Clear --> Gate
  Departure --> Gate
  Motion[Committed movement and activity facts] --> View[Artist models / packages / occupants / clips / wheels / sway / exhaust]
  View -.-> NoAuthority[Presentation never creates stock / people / fuel / time]
